WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:03.190
Question!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.270
First time fighting in this terrain

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:06.748
How do you survive?

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:08.000
Defense first!

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:08.680
Get into formation!

00:00:08.884 --> 00:00:10.180
Uh-uh!

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:11.600
The best defense?

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:13.287
Don't let the enemy find you

00:00:13.287 --> 00:00:14.370
Hehe

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:16.140
This "Druzhna training footage"

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:17.300
Will make me a fortune!

00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:19.120
So

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.660
If you can hide from me for the next three minutes...

00:00:22.319 --> 00:00:25.231
You get double dessert with your next ration!

00:00:25.332 --> 00:00:25.940
Uh... Huh?

00:00:26.032 --> 00:00:26.980
Let's begin!

00:00:27.835 --> 00:00:29.375
Whoooooa!

00:00:31.432 --> 00:00:32.163
Out!

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:37.695
You're out!

00:00:42.925 --> 00:00:43.914
You're out

00:00:44.718 --> 00:00:45.780
Aaaaah!

00:00:46.891 --> 00:00:48.031
Out

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:50.445
Found you

00:00:50.591 --> 00:00:51.870
Heavy footsteps...

00:00:51.979 --> 00:00:53.220
Loud breathing...

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:57.083
When you find the perfect hiding spot

00:00:57.083 --> 00:00:58.913
You should ask yourself this

00:00:58.913 --> 00:01:01.210
How well hidden am I really?

00:01:02.123 --> 00:01:04.225
That's all for today's anti-recon training

00:01:04.308 --> 00:01:05.127
Dismissed!

00:01:05.991 --> 00:01:07.025
No... No!

00:01:07.164 --> 00:01:08.877
These are useless!

00:01:08.877 --> 00:01:10.960
What sort of training is this anyway!?

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:17.855
Hello there!

00:01:17.855 --> 00:01:19.485
Are you a tourist from abroad?

00:01:19.677 --> 00:01:22.780
Or a spy sent by my colleagues...?

00:01:23.763 --> 00:01:25.093
I... I'm...

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:26.090
Shh, don't answer that

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:28.020
Watching us from a distance

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:29.380
Must be boring...

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:32.173
Why don't you join in the fun?

00:01:39.408 --> 00:01:40.842
You're just going to let her go?

00:01:41.462 --> 00:01:44.114
*yawn* She's a small fry

00:01:44.476 --> 00:01:45.572
Someone must've paid her

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:47.082
For intel on the Druzhna

00:01:47.255 --> 00:01:48.937
...Or dirt, maybe

00:01:49.717 --> 00:01:50.835
I'll leave the rest to you

00:01:51.161 --> 00:01:53.531
We don't have the time to follow up

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:55.346
More importantly...

00:01:56.298 --> 00:01:58.153
She's a pretty good photographer!

00:01:58.268 --> 00:02:00.228
I'm going to put these in my album!

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.265
Ooh, what a great angle!

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:04.465
And the backdrop looks great!

00:02:04.465 --> 00:02:06.044
...But you have time for this?

00:02:07.451 --> 00:02:09.042
Ah, and this one's— Huh?

00:02:09.101 --> 00:02:09.601
...Hm?

00:02:12.138 --> 00:02:13.451
How dare she...

00:02:14.406 --> 00:02:16.820
I'm going to stuff her inside a snowman!

00:02:21.424 --> 00:02:22.264
...Pfft

